{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202390","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120239001:1":{"text":"역시 이길 수 없는 건가…","source_cn":"我果然还是赢不了你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D6436EDF300008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120239002:1":{"text":"포기해. 나는 돌아가지 않는다.","source_cn":"放弃吧，我不会和你回去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF57664C80007B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120239003:1":{"text":"포기하지 않겠어.","source_cn":"我不会放弃。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC560ECDC3E0F62CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"포기하지 않겠어.","female":"포기하지 않겠어.","variant_male_record_index":"120005","variant_female_record_index":"120006","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120239004:1":{"text":"너의 마음을 되돌리진 못했지만, 아버지께서 어렵게 이룬 성과를 다른 사람에게 양보하지 않을 것이다.","source_cn":"虽然我打不过你，但我绝不会把父亲好不容易的得到的族长之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD74ED80C47388EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120239005:1":{"text":"네가 족장을 계승하지 않아도 상관없어. 내 힘으로 크루거를 꺾고 블랙하울의 족장이 될 테니까!","source_cn":"你不愿意继承族长，无所谓。我会凭借自己的力量赢过克鲁格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D9933A129AB3A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120239006:1":{"text":"편할 대로. 블랙하울 부족은 나와 상관없어.","source_cn":"随便你。我说过的，你们黑嚎氏族的事情与我无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EB6FDFEF8A8866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120239007:1":{"text":"…꼭 성공해서 보여주지.","source_cn":"……我会成功给你看的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x539B2D8A2478B9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120239008:1":{"text":"그러니까 너도 와서 내가 크루거를 꺾는 모습을 꼭 보도록 해.","source_cn":"所以，你也过来吧，见证我打败克鲁格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01BABAA882777746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120239009:1":{"text":"우리 가보지 않을래? 꽤 궁금한데.","source_cn":"我们要过去看看吗？我还挺好奇的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD764F73C52443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120239009":{"text":"우리 가보지 않을래? 꽤 궁금한데.","source_cn":"我们要过去看看吗？我还挺好奇的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD764F73C52443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120239010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 역시 나랑 잘 맞다니까!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x239F27CC90185663","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 역시 나랑 잘 맞다니까!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 역시 나랑 잘 맞다니까!","variant_male_record_index":"120013","variant_female_record_index":"120014","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120239011:1":{"text":"우르 부족의 족장으로서 방문하는 건 어때?","source_cn":"就当是作为乌尔氏族的族长，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7994A401022795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120239014:1":{"text":"…정 그렇다면 우르 부족을 대표해서 그 결투를 지켜보도록 하지. 하지만 거기까지야.","source_cn":"……既然如此，我们会作为乌尔氏族的代表见证这件事，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1598911ADB1C5749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"우리도 가자","source_cn":"我们过去吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0409A711372ED638","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 가자","female":"우리도 가자","variant_male_record_index":"63440","variant_female_record_index":"63441","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120239012:1":{"text":"…누가 이기든 상관없어. 난 별로 가고 싶지 않아.","source_cn":"……对我来说，他们谁赢都无所谓。但我不太想再过去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E28B7AE69B51A27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120239013:1":{"text":"…우르 부족의 족장으로서 아센 사막의 다른 부족의 족장 탄생을 지켜봐야지 않겠어?","source_cn":"……以乌尔氏族族长的名义呢，我们需要荒角沙漠另一个氏族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA9F363F3808C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"소렌에게 결정을 맡기자","source_cn":"索恩决定吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D91094E57DF3F9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소렌에게 결정을 맡기자","female":"소렌에게 결정을 맡기자","variant_male_record_index":"63442","variant_female_record_index":"63443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}